				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Serve drinks while your bar falls apart.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Barfender</strong> is a chaotic co-op bar sim where fights break out, drinks spill, and you’re still trying to keep orders moving.</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Customers get drunk, impatient, and start fights</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Orders pile up faster than you can handle</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Glasses shatter and the mess keeps spreading</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unwanted guests wander in, thieves grab what they can</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Serve drinks, clean disasters, stop fights, and hold the bar together before it completely collapses.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Serve Under Pressure</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Pour beers, shake cocktails, fake a smile, and mop up puke while the night spirals out of control.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/38ca568ea484706498b10bca76ae0d3b.poster.avif?t=1792782343" aria-label="Serve Under Pressure" width=780 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/38ca568ea484706498b10bca76ae0d3b.webm?t=1792782343" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/38ca568ea484706498b10bca76ae0d3b.mp4?t=1792782343" type="video/mp4"></video></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Online Co-op Chaos</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Serve customers together with friends. Maybe don’t smash a beer mug into your teammate’s face… or do!</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/60d46b3df18850d73cd7f388e49b326e.poster.avif?t=1792782343" aria-label="Online Co-op Chaos" width=780 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/60d46b3df18850d73cd7f388e49b326e.webm?t=1792782343" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/60d46b3df18850d73cd7f388e49b326e.mp4?t=1792782343" type="video/mp4"></video></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Problematic Customers</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Polite regulars, rowdy drunks, hopeless romantics, bar brawlers. Everyone here has a personality.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/a3a7a3f56b1b9fd8b1e5dfdb75fc29e4.poster.avif?t=1792782343" aria-label="Problematic Customers" width=780 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/a3a7a3f56b1b9fd8b1e5dfdb75fc29e4.webm?t=1792782343" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/a3a7a3f56b1b9fd8b1e5dfdb75fc29e4.mp4?t=1792782343" type="video/mp4"></video></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Design The Bar Which You'll Probably Ruin Later</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Style your bar to perfection. Then pray the crowd doesn’t tear it apart.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/6dd7b9962db49802670eeb3675c95ce4.poster.avif?t=1792782343" aria-label="Design The Bar Which You&#039;ll Probably Ruin Later" width=780 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/6dd7b9962db49802670eeb3675c95ce4.webm?t=1792782343" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/6dd7b9962db49802670eeb3675c95ce4.mp4?t=1792782343" type="video/mp4"></video></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Unlock Drinks, Tools, and Upgrades</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Craft better drinks. Expand the bar. Lead your crew from a scrappy old bar to a thriving nightlife empire.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/25f4e5473b540deb272a1f30304682f9.poster.avif?t=1792782343" aria-label="Unlock Drinks, Tools, and Upgrades" width=780 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/25f4e5473b540deb272a1f30304682f9.webm?t=1792782343" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/25f4e5473b540deb272a1f30304682f9.mp4?t=1792782343" type="video/mp4"></video></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Bar Games and Activities</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Blow off steam with darts, pool, retro arcade machines, and a wild rodeo bull.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/8657b76be465f70227e383a909ac140d.poster.avif?t=1792782343" aria-label="Bar Games and Activities" width=780 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/8657b76be465f70227e383a909ac140d.webm?t=1792782343" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/8657b76be465f70227e383a909ac140d.mp4?t=1792782343" type="video/mp4"></video></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Booze and Bad Decisions</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Keep tempers down before it turns into a full-blown bar fight... or your wallet pays the price.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/0062a7b43734eb91d154b78a4ab8ed08.poster.avif?t=1792782343" aria-label="Booze and Bad Decisions" width=780 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/0062a7b43734eb91d154b78a4ab8ed08.webm?t=1792782343" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159680/extras/0062a7b43734eb91d154b78a4ab8ed08.mp4?t=1792782343" type="video/mp4"></video></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p>						</div>
					</div>
